{
  "id": 8835550511303,
  "title": "Custom Trucking Semi Truck Under Starry Night Sky Comforter",
  "handle": "custom-trucking-semi-truck-under-starry-night-sky-comforter-6bbe1b0cd5-6bbe1b0cd5",
  "body_html": "<p>Transform your bedroom with the Custom Trucker Bedding Set, brought to you by Jeminise. This modern comforter set is designed specifically for trucking enthusiasts, featuring a striking graphic illustration of a semi-truck under a starry night sky. Perfect as a cozy addition to your bed or as a thoughtful, personalized gift for family and friends, this bedding set allows you to enter a custom name to make it truly unique.</p>\n\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Customize this trucker bedding with your own text input, such as a name, to create a one-of-a-kind look.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Cozy Feel:</strong> Made from 100% brushed polyester fabric with whole-piece microfiber filling to prevent clumping or shifting.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Choose from standard US bedding sizes including Twin (68\" x 88\"), Full (78\" x 88\"), Queen (88\" x 88\"), and King (104\" x 88\").</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> Features one duvet cover or comforter, with the option to add matching pillowcases or a flat sheet.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water on a gentle cycle; air dry without heat or tumble dry on low heat for quick fluffing.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Superior Craftsmanship:</strong> Smooth, fine, and compact stitching along the edges ensures long-lasting durability and color vibrancy.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Comforter Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fill Material</th>\n<td>Microfiber</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Love Trucker</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Trucker</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Cartoon</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Modern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
